 ## [Unreleased]
+
+- **Navigate invokable route class strings.** Laravel class-string handlers without `@method` support class definition, hover, references, rename and completion using runtime namespaces. Bare controller-group methods retain their meaning; unknown contexts preserve incomplete results and refuse partial class renames. Registration does not count as constructor execution. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Complete runtime controller classes.** Laravel route action and group-controller strings offer class suggestions with rooted, quote-aware class-only edits. PHP imports stay unchanged; ambiguous namespaces and bounded catalogs preserve incomplete results. Completion resolve and unsaved class declarations use the shared class catalog. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
